From 9c78be7705107edc9eb64d105397676488ffd885 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rams95 <rams95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:08:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0015-settings-tabs-key-prompts.patch

Settings in tabs (Display, Picture, Sound, Controls, Game; Tab/Q/E/L1/R1, mouse), window size presets, the game's blur filter
switch, sound chip reverb switch, Game tab in the same panel as the others.
Key prompts: the game's font (a texture override made by tools/rd_prompts.py) gets key caps with the player's keys in place of
the PlayStation symbols (PS2_PROMPT_FONT_KEY, PS2_PROMPT_CELLS, ps2::set_button_prompts), remade when a key changes; key caps
and PlayStation symbols on the Change keys page.
Lens rain follows the map's weather (PS2_LENS_WEATHER): trails, stretched beads, mist.
Texture overrides fit the device's largest buffer binding (no crash on 128 MB devices).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
